This laboratory adapts the application/main/graphics_internal architecture from
https://github.com/vladeemerr/vulkan-starter-app (Apache-2.0).
Modified for laboratory 1, variant 8 and its six additional tasks: cylinder
geometry, matrix transformations, projection switching, controlled animation,
object colors multiplied by procedural vertex colors, and multiple objects
with separate descriptor sets. Build scripts and MoltenVK support enable macOS
compilation and execution.
